rooms_desc ({"You have entered the apartment of Tuff, the grand adventurer.  Decorated in hisnormal haphazard manner, you recognise it as the ultimate bachelor pad.  A largescreen hangs on the far wall, showing him images of the other players on the MUDand he flicks through the channels in moments of boredom and watches how the otherguilds operate.  Not as if any of that matters to our Tuff, he's happy to live anddie by the whims of the monsters he encounters every day.  Not the richest playerby any means, this small room seems a little cramped and overcrowded at times,especially when he has friends over to visit.  But it is sufficient for his needs,and he seems pretty happy here....",0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,})
